    "s_compare": {"x": 6080, "y": 1300, "w": 420, "text": "Pick: D's mechanics (zoomable field, shuffle, trail, Surprise) wearing A's editorial restraint (strict grid, big type, one accent).\n\nB is fun but noisy at 100 buildings. C is beautiful but slow: one building at a time kills the 'one more' loop.", "fill": "blue"},
